    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "The full test suite is green \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS` with all tests passing (Failures: 0, Errors: 0).\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented `contactPreference` = `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`, following the codebase's established pattern for derived Owner fields (OpenAPI-generated DTO + MapStruct expression mapper).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `contactPreference` string property (enum `EMAIL`/`PHONE`) to the `Owner` schema. The `openapi-generator-maven-plugin` generates `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum` from this at build time.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added `@Mapping(target = \"contactPreference\", expression = \"java(contactPreference(owner))\")` on `toOwnerDto`, plus a `contactPreference(Owner)` default method that returns `EMAIL` when the email is non-null/non-blank (reusing the same presence check as `membershipLevel`), else `PHONE`.\n\nNo controller change was needed. Both new acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) pass and the full suite remains green.",
